  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Aniket @ Prakash Sambhaji Kamble vs The State Of Maharashtra Thr Pso Ps ... on 16 February, 2026 1 42aba129.202 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Nagpur Bench, Nagpur. Criminal Application (Aba) No. 129 Of 2026 (Anikt @ Prakash Sambhaji Kamble Vs. State, th Pso, Ps Samudrapur, Dist. Wardha) ________________________________________________________________ Office Notes, Office Memoranda of Coram, appearances, Court's orders of directions Court's or Judge's orders and Registrar's Orders. 2. The applicant is seeking anticipatory bail in connection with Crime No. 10/2026, registered with Police Station Samudrapur, District Wardha, for the offences punishable under Sections 123,318(4), 336(2), 336(3), 340(2), 274,275,223, 3(5) of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 and Sections 65(e), 77(a), 83 of the Maharashtra Prohibition Act and Sections 3((1)(zz)(iv) (v), 26(2)(i), 26(2)(iv),27(i), 30(2)(a) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "2. The applicant is seeking anticipatory bail in connection with Crime No. 10/2026, registered with Police Station Samudrapur, District Wardha, for the offences punishable under Sections 123,318(4), 336(2), 336(3), 340(2), 274,275,223, 3(5) of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 and Sections 65(e), 77(a), 83 of the Maharashtra Prohibition Act and Sections 3((1)(zz)(iv) (v), 26(2)(i), 26(2)(iv),27(i), 30(2)(a) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 5. The contention is that, the allegation against the applicant is that the scented tobacco and liquor which belongs to the applicant, has already been seized.",
